@verbs account password details chfn notifications
@tier player
@title your password, your details and what you missed
@see quit

  password

Changes your password. It asks for the one you have, the new one,
and the new one again. It has to be six characters or more. If
anything does not match, it cancels without changing a thing.

  details

The personal details of your account: real name, where you live and
your birthday. You are asked one at a time, and leaving the line
blank keeps what was there; 'none' clears it.

  notifications

Shows you again the notices the game has been giving you, with the
time each one arrived.
